exports[`every refusal's advice is a proposal the check takes > edge-into-ambiguous: is met, and each way it says to put it right is accepted 1`] = `"The edge from "Pic" says no into, and "nano-banana-pro-edit-ultra" takes an image node more than one way. "Pic" goes into "Gen" by an edge with into: "pool" and a ref @'ing it and a note saying what to do first, or by an edge with into: "style_images" and a note saying to pick it there and no ref."`;

